meta {
  name: Get Contracts
  type: http
  seq: 4
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/options/contracts/AAPL
  body: none
  auth: none
}

headers {
  Accept: application/json
}

docs {
  # Inspect Loaded Contracts — One Underlying

  Full per-contract detail for one underlying held in memory: each generated OCC
  symbol, its type (CALL/PUT), strike, moneyness (ITM/OTM), expiry, the number of
  bars loaded, and any per-contract error.

  Inspection only — run POST /api/options/load (or /load/{underlying}) first.

  ## Path
  - `/{underlying}` — the underlying stock symbol (e.g. AAPL).

  ## Response (200)
  {
    underlying, spot, expiry, strikeIncrement, contracts, loaded, error?, loadedAt,
    contractDetail: [ { occSymbol, type, strike, moneyness, expiry, barCount,
                        loaded, error? } ]
  }

  ## Errors
  - `404` — nothing loaded for that underlying yet (POST /api/options/load/{underlying} first).
}
